/**  Stage D: flows and waves ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 * Langmuir cells: counter-rotating roll pairs along the wind, drift lines gather in the convergence zones.
 *
 * @param uv        The coordinate. (in)
 * @param cells     The number of cells. (in)
